global gFarg

on mouseUp
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 9 ............................ <the clickOn>
  [  4] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [  6] sub ..................................... <the clickOn - 25>
  [  7] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  9] add ..................................... <the clickOn - 25 + 1>
  [ 10] setglobal 4 ............................. gFarg = the clickOn - 25 + 1
  [ 12] getglobal 4 ............................. <gFarg>
  [ 14] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [ 16] gt ...................................... <gFarg > 4>
  [ 17] getglobal 4 ............................. <gFarg>
  [ 19] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 20] lt ...................................... <gFarg < 0>
  [ 21] or ...................................... <(gFarg > 4) or (gFarg < 0)>
  [ 22] jmpifz [ 28] ............................ if (gFarg > 4) or (gFarg < 0) then
  [ 25] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 26] setglobal 4 ............................. gFarg = 0
  [ 28] ret
end
